WEBVTT

00:34:25.663 --> 00:34:31.954
Yes, I would really like to sit down
privately and have dinner with the pope.

00:34:32.579 --> 00:34:33.579
What would you talk about?

00:34:33.996 --> 00:34:35.663
Well, it would depend. I mean,

00:34:35.663 --> 00:34:40.038
I don't really talk to people about
anything until I sussed them out,

00:34:40.038 --> 00:34:45.079
as it were, and found a piece of common
ground and something that you can share

00:34:45.621 --> 00:34:48.538
and then let the conversation run.

00:34:48.538 --> 00:34:53.079
But he's been so outspoken and amazing
about the environment.

00:34:53.579 --> 00:34:55.704
And, you know, he actually has said just

00:34:55.704 --> 00:34:58.788
because we can breed like rabbits
doesn't mean we should,